                <pb facs="0438" n="336" sameAs="frus:frus1943/pg336"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>For related documentation, see <ref target="frus:frus1943v01">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1943, vol. I</ref>, index
                    entries under “Refugees From Europe and the Middle East, governmental efforts
                    for relief of”, and especially (for the immediate background of the discussions
                    of the <hi rendition="#small-caps">Trident</hi> Conference) Hull’s memorandum of
                    May 7, 1943, and Roosevelt’s reply of May 14, <ref
                        target="frus:frus1943v01/pg_176">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, pp. 176</ref>–<ref
                        target="frus:frus1943v01/pg_179">179</ref>.</p>
            </div>
